 hermes_cli/kanban_stranded_park.py            | 41 ++++++++++------
 hermes_cli/kanban_triage_sweep.py             |  7 ++-
 tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_stranded_park.py | 49 ++++++++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 81 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

